{"agent":"Monster3-SW-ledger-7267fe","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"`_models` only records `session.started` events when `d[\"model\"]` is non-empty, so it cannot represent “latest session before the claim had no model.” If agent A starts a session at t=1 with `model=\"gpt-4\"` and later at t=2 starts a session with no/empty `model`, `_author_model` falls back to the older `\"gpt-4\"` at the later claim. The key becomes `(family_for(\"gpt-4\", ...), \"gpt-4\", ...)`, not `(\"\", \"\")`. This contradicts the module contract: \"An author whose model cannot be told is keyed `(\"\", \"\")`, never guessed.\" The code should record the model-less session as a marker so the fallback does not leap over it.","digest":"cfd5d0061921fa27","location":"ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:_models","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:_models"},{"chunk":3,"detail":"The call `log2.add(\"lease.acquired\", \"B\", \"y\", T0, holder=\"y\", at=T0, model=\"deepseek-v4\", globs=[])` passes the event time `T0` both as the fourth positional argument and again as `at=T0`. In the `Log.add` helper from `lanes_fixture` imported by this test, the fourth positional parameter is `at`, so Python raises `TypeError: got multiple values for argument 'at'` when `test_lease_model_wins_and_equal_time_sessions_keep_log_order` runs. The test never reaches its assertion, so the new test suite fails on this function.","digest":"975da77209a41f15","location":"tests/test_swarm_ledger.py:133","severity":"HIGH","title":"tests/test_swarm_ledger.py:133"}],"chunks_total":3,"coverage":"3/3 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":15106,"diff_sha":"34777ea999d43a88ec94079c737d8dd0d70375b2ffc9ec385f26dadb97824fbc","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":966.2,"family":"deepseek","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"771b22b0bfdcdafa","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/SW-ledger.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261030T074500Z-fc0b369e.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-SW-ledger-7267fe reviewed impl-sw-ledger's SW-ledger","reviewed_head":"6661daa44b5d0631c628606376e02cb9730fc221","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/swarm/__init__.py":"100644 3816aa951defb80a06c5b47c8d0b9413411f4e56","ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py":"100644 877373f998899adc27841bd0b3dceb972ea15e4d","tests/test_swarm_ledger.py":"100644 a092f70af25c21afa01cf2498fc1243bd0bc06f2"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b8632","round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:_models","tests/test_swarm_ledger.py:133"],"tree_sha":"6661daa44b5d+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"e752e63eb4f22ed24e34ea5c5","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":113952,"schema":1,"subject":"SW-ledger","ts":"2026-10-30T08:01:07.219417Z"}
