{"agent":"Monster3-SW-ledger-7267fe","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"`key = Key(family_for(model, fam_map or None), model, _kind(state, span.item, span.kind))` passes the **model** string as the first argument to `config_sections.agent.family_for`, but that function takes the agent/author as its first argument, and `fam_map` is the agent→family map from `cfg.agent.families`. For example, with agent `alice` configured as family `red` and a session/lease model `opus`, the item is credited under `Key(\"opus\", \"opus\", kind)` (or `family_for`'s fallback for an unknown agent key), not `Key(\"red\", \"opus\", kind)`. Since this key is the whole point of the quality ledger, all cells are attributed to the wrong family whenever the model differs from the agent id and is not itself present in the family map.","digest":"f050e958cd9491fb","location":"ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:build","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:build"}],"chunks_total":3,"coverage":"3/3 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":15995,"diff_sha":"ffb62ee41199496829f6e5f953205066aeec7f7eb23df5da14947640b0adc303","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":991.8,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"54c8dbe32d4d7b2d","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/SW-ledger.critic.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261030T093218Z-0208b681.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-SW-ledger-7267fe reviewed impl-sw-ledger's SW-ledger","reviewed_head":"15abce5f90201ab29caa476d10f1d3ec954ed215","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/swarm/__init__.py":"100644 3816aa951defb80a06c5b47c8d0b9413411f4e56","ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py":"100644 cec86d482f9928cda4cf912299e41dbbf